── The guide ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The written content and the compiled price research — payload.json,
entries.json, the research and estimation outputs, the verdict methodology and
all prose on the site — are licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

In plain terms: build whatever you like on the machinery, including for money.
Share the research with attribution, and not for commercial use. Individual
menu prices are facts and nobody owns them; the work is in the collecting,
the sourcing and the scoring, and that is what this covers.

Menu data is captured from each program's public listings and from restaurants'
own published menus. These guides are unofficial and unaffiliated with any
tourism board, program organiser or restaurant.
